# Middleware

## Framework semantics

Middleware forms the PSR-style request/response queue configured on the Application.

## Required behavior

- Place cross-cutting HTTP pipeline concerns in middleware.
- Do not push domain/persistence logic into middleware by default.
- Respect existing middleware order in the project.

## Anti-patterns

- Middleware as a replacement for every cross-cutting concern